  <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:.5rem">Completely free.</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem">No credit card, no upgrade prompt, no catch. Every quest, every sprint, every rung.</p>
  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="card price-card" style="max-width:26rem;margin:0 auto">
