</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <h2>Your boss isn&rsquo;t going to fire themselves.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Join free, pick one of nine paths, and start the climb tonight. Level 5 is a stranger paying you money that has nothing to do with your job.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/paths">Find your path &rarr;</a>
</section>

